						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														It has come to my attention that a raid into MM is needed for certain drops for our members ie: quest items and just plain old good drops that would look good on us hehe.  Ok this is the deal.<br />
    We need to do this real bad.  It would be our 1st official raid and I guarantee a successfull raid.  MM itself is very dangerous place but with 1 solid group any camp there can be beaten.  If we get more people to attendend ( which is what I am hoping for ) we can spread ourselves around and camp multiple things.  Running amok in MM can work too because certain drops are random off random things.<br />
    I really hate setting Lvls that can attend but I recommend at least 20th lvl people having the best sucess because the entrance area in MM is 20-25 mobs and they spawn very fast.  I really dont want to set a date because this can be done spurr of the moment thing whenever we have alot of people on ( I usually see about 10-15 people on when I am on ) but if a date is needed then either Maktar or myself will set one.  <br />
    Again we really need to do this, lets flex our muscles a bit and reap the rewards!<br />
<br />
Agrivar Noble paladin Advisor						</td>
